  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterCasino1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Listen\u2026 about what we discussed yesterday\u2026 are you sure? If Cyber
    agrees, everything should go smoothly. "
  - "It benefits him too. Besides, I doubt he\u2019d ever dare to do it on his own."
  - "Thanks to you, the plan\u2019s actually thought through, so preparation\u2019s
    gonna take at least a month anyway\u2026 But what about Beast? Have you talked
    to him yet?"
  - "Yeah. He\u2019s completely on board. The documents shouldn\u2019t be a problem
    either \u2014 he has connections here who can help us cross the border in general."
  - "As for Spain\u2026 his whole family works in law enforcement. He hasn\u2019t
    spoken to them in years, but he says they\u2019ll take us in. He\u2019ll talk
    to Ferret. Cyber\u2019s on me. "
  - "Got it, got it. Let\u2019s not think about the plan right now though, or you\u2019ll
    start overloading your brain again."
  - "Better tell me this instead\u2026 we\u2019re gonna have new names and surnames,
    right? What name do you want? "
  - "Ha-ha\u2026 you\u2019re being a little dumb right now. Asahi, America legally
    doesn\u2019t cooperate with Europe anymore. To Europe, we\u2019re political refugees.
    We\u2019ll get new Euro-format documents depending on where we make them. "
  - "If we\u2019re criminals here, that doesn\u2019t automatically mean anything
    there. Even if we were serial killers \u2014 which, by the way, wouldn\u2019t
    exactly be great \u2014 it\u2019d still make things easier for us."
  - The fake documents are only a worst-case backup to get us OUT of here.
  - Yeah, yeah. Laws, corporations, maniacs, villains, corruption, politics, blah
    blah blah. I got it. So you wanna stay Abigail forever?
  - "I\u2026 actually like my name. It\u2019s pretty. Pretentious, but pretty. I\u2019ll
    only change the surname. "
  - "You know\u2026 I actually have an idea about that. "
  - "I\u2019m listening. "
  - "What about\u2026 \u201CNam\u201D?"
  - "What? That\u2019s your surname\u2026 Wait. Are you trying to decide whether
    to change yours? "
  - "No, I mean\u2026 you know. Wayne Nam. Abigail Nam. Sounds like it fits you\u2026
    don\u2019t you think?"
  - "Goddamn\u2026 I\u2019m pretending I didn\u2019t hear that."
  - "Well\u2026 guess I\u2019ll just have to repeat it later then. But seriously,
    what about the temporary documents?"
  - "I\u2019ll pick something random and call it a day."
  - "Eve, I will wear you down eventually. Me personally? I\u2019ll be\u2026 \u201CEdward
    Stingray.\u201D Thoughts?"
  - "Hilarious. In that case, I\u2019ll be\u2026 \u201CMaria Drozdova.\u201D I look
    about as Slavic as you look British. Anyway, I still have to talk to Cyber."
  - "Hm. You could\u2019ve picked something Asian at least\u2026 why go straight
    for \u201CSlavic\u201D? Either way, I\u2019m expecting you in my room tonight.
    Otherwise I\u2019ll report you and say you\u2019re a deserter who refuses to
    acknowledge my heart\u2014"
  - "Ew\u2026 don\u2019t talk to me anymore. Disgusting. Blackmailer. Psychopath."
